<title>BRAZIL: CVRD bid specs to include base price.</title>
<headline>CVRD bid specs to include base price.</headline>
<dateline>SAO PAULO 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bid specifications for the privatization of state mining giant Companhia Vale do Rio Doce are likely to include the firm's base price, said Planning Minister Antonio Kandir.</p>
<p>Kandir, speaking at a seminar on private savings, said the tender documents could also include the date of the auction of a 40-45 percent voting stake in Vale.</p>
<p>Earlier Kandir said the Brazilian government would publish the bid specifications next week.</p>
<p>Vale's privatization is expected to begin in April.</p>
<p>((--Romina Nicaretta, Sao Paulo Newsroom, 5511 2485418))</p>
